flowchart LR
    U[User Browser] --> A[Next.js Frontend]

    subgraph FE[Frontend Layer]
        A --> RP[RoomRouteClient]
        A --> CP[CollaborationProvider]
        CP --> EB[Typed Event Bus]
        EB --> ST[Zustand Stores]
        ST --> UI[RoomShell / Sidebar / Editor / Terminal / Chat]
        UI --> M[Monaco Editor]
        M --> Y[Yjs CRDT]
    end

    A <--> S[Socket.IO Client]
    S <--> G[Realtime Gateway (Socket.IO Server)]

    subgraph BE[Backend Collaboration Services]
        G --> RH[room.handlers]
        G --> FH[fs.handlers]
        G --> YH[yjs.handlers]
        G --> TH[terminal.handlers]
        G --> CH[chat / presence handlers]
    end

    RH <--> RS[room.service]
    RS <--> DB[(Supabase DB)]

    FH <--> SS[(Object Storage + Room Tree State)]
    YH <--> YD[(Per-file Y Docs)]

    TH <--> J[Judge0 Execution]
    TH --> L[terminal:session + terminal:log events]
    L --> UI

    CH --> P[presence:update / collab:history]
    P --> ST
